      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the hints given.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/15974-5_b11e3d4c.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, Ben! What are you doing so early in the morning?</p>\n<p>Ben: Oh, I&#8217;m helping my dad. We just finished <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.1</label><input id='fbo-894696-0' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='0' name='fbo-894696-0' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894696-0' /></span></strong> the cows.</p>\n<p>Anna: That sounds like a lot of work! Do you do it every day?</p>\n<p>Ben: Yes, we have to. After that, I also help <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.2</label><input id='fbo-894696-1' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='1' name='fbo-894696-1' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894696-1' /></span></strong> the chickens and pigs. What about you?</p>\n<p>Anna: I&#8217;m on my way to the garden to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>12.3</label><input id='fbo-894696-2' class='ms fillblank-option-12' index='2' name='fbo-894696-2' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894696-2' /></span></strong> some eggs from the henhouse.</p>\n<p>Ben: Life in the countryside keeps us busy, doesn&#8217;t it?</p>\n<p>Anna: It sure does, but I love it. Let&#8217;s meet later at the field to play badminton.</p>\n<p>Ben: That sounds good! See you then!</p>",
