      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the text, using the words given.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.03%; height: 70px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.0558%; text-align: center;\"><strong>hard-working</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.0558%; text-align: center;\"><strong>plough</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.057%; text-align: center;\"><strong>enjoyable</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.0558%; text-align: center;\"><strong>early</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.0558%; text-align: center;\"><strong>herd</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.057%; text-align: center;\"><strong>vast</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>Life in rural areas includes natural beauty and hard work. People wake up <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.1</label><input id='fbo-894473-0' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='0' name='fbo-894473-0' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-0' /></span></strong> to feed and take care of the animals. Farmers <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.2</label><input id='fbo-894473-1' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='1' name='fbo-894473-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-1' /></span></strong> the land to prepare for planting, and during the harvest, families work together to gather the crops. They may also <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.3</label><input id='fbo-894473-2' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='2' name='fbo-894473-2' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-2' /></span></strong> their cows and goats across the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.4</label><input id='fbo-894473-3' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='3' name='fbo-894473-3' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-3' /></span></strong> open fields. Despite the need to be <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.5</label><input id='fbo-894473-4' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='4' name='fbo-894473-4' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-4' /></span></strong>, many people find rural life calm and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.6</label><input id='fbo-894473-5' class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='5' name='fbo-894473-5' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-894473-5' /></span></strong>.</p>",
